// Headless command scenarios: real command dispatch against the imported core.
// Commands run as the non-programmer fixture (#101). `;` evals run as the wizard:
// the core restricts eval to programmers, so non-programmer evals return E_PERM
// and would mask assertion results.
//
// Command invocation permissions are covered by the merged runtime regressions.

@wizard
; return #101.location;
#103

// look executes the room look path for a normal player
@nonprogrammer
% look

// movement through fixture exits
% east
@wizard
; return #101.location;
#104

@nonprogrammer
% west
@wizard
; return #101.location;
#103

// take and drop move the fixture thing
; return #107.location;
#103

@nonprogrammer
% take thing
@wizard
; return #107.location;
#101

@nonprogrammer
% drop thing
@wizard
; return #107.location;
#103

// speech command path executes for a normal player
@nonprogrammer
% say hello
@wizard
; return 1;
1
